{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a8336ce376d3bfaf97a3259984a1c97b1277c77500025d3a5b364337e391a3c1", "ja": "（恵美のPV撮影はスタッフさんも絶賛する最高の\n出来だった。恵美の顔も晴れ晴れとしている）", "zh": "（惠美的PV拍摄效果好得不得了，连工作人员都赞不绝口。惠美的脸上也满是灿烂的笑容。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "e6f37fe675a9c39c7c48c592460648cf8e9098cc077828bffc08663d409a2df9", "ja": "今日は200％ぐらいの力が出た気がするよ～。\nPVの完成、楽しみだね～♪", "zh": "感觉今天发挥出了大约200％的实力呢～  \n真期待PV完成的样子啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1002_p", "source_sha256": "56be9cd628933293e2c73a111f3b14ab7dee5b175e445a7303044cf9627d3271", "ja": "そうだな。撮影をみてたけど、\nずっと絶好調なのがよくわかったよ。", "zh": "是啊。我一直看着拍摄，也能明显感觉到你从头到尾状态都特别好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "b83f93a907f45edc20b481c9889a01aeab1c5893884d71808b977dcf4d2af00a", "ja": "本当？　{$P$}にもバレてた！？", "zh": "真的吗？连{$P$}也看出来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bdbe0e41de494cbd2be556def925f15fbddf1f9895d6e1d99347bca03830d1e7", "ja": "ああ。表情や動きのひとつひとつが決まってたしな。\nそれに、恵美の強い気持ちも伝わってきたよ。", "zh": "是啊。每一个表情和动作都恰到好处。\n而且，惠美那份强烈的心意也传达给我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "b907dbacc85d36738deecbead809392e64b55f3b5929338d1ae04b535712d26f", "ja": "そっかそっかぁ……よかったぁ……。", "zh": "这样啊这样啊……太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "b6e16638a2f1170f7ab45150435d008fb87ffeb6beec2e3b92b630ed7dd5a602", "ja": "あっ！　でも安心するのはまだ早いよね。\nむしろこれからっていうか……。", "zh": "啊！不过现在放心还太早了对吧。\n倒不如说接下来才是关键……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1007_p", "source_sha256": "585a8b6008354f25de2097a0b114772a6d5cab1ae103a45b21e6f4b17e2b520b", "ja": "ん？　恵美、何の話をしているんだ？", "zh": "嗯？恵美，你在说什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "8b7448be01c5c8c292d1726a2be9b712b1071959ee22955d6f0669bc38e5c15c", "ja": "何のって……このまま真剣にアイドルやったら、\nどこまで行けるのかなって話！", "zh": "什么话……是说，如果就这样认真地做偶像，究竟能走到哪一步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "de8583cbbbd25e6cb561cf78121c3f80d5d1a7e41f8abbb9690bdf3a51ac720b", "ja": "いや～。目標とかは、まだ決まってないんだけどね。\nでも今日の撮影で、今の実力がわかったからさ。", "zh": "哎呀～虽然具体的目标什么的，我还没定下来啦。\n不过今天的拍摄，让我弄清了自己现在的实力嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "aaa9ed8102079d14496dbf7ffccaba995b1dcd4da4ce9edb6e841e0813249732", "ja": "このまま、アイドルを続けたら、\nどんな景色が待ってるのかなーって考えちゃって。", "zh": "要是就这样继续当偶像，不知道前方会有怎样的景色在等着我呢——我不由得这样想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7209ff29060f0854ba735b981c9c6e343e843f5c2abe9bf3b293c27049ae6753", "ja": "……そうだな。\n恵美の頑張り次第で、いくらでも景色は変わると思う。", "zh": "……是啊。\n我觉得，景色会根据惠美的努力，发生各种各样的变化。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "e43a7228e8fe08b72cf52582fd0eb8ef8b16e879c58e3850d9c7e267fe8317f0", "ja": "あ。なんか他人事みたいに言ってるけど～。", "zh": "啊。说得好像事不关己一样～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "f36d272c402fba6531e7ed1b99e57c5d211ac4f8963cb7e6a2baf3cd19e69877", "ja": "アタシが見てる景色には、\nいつでも{$P$}がいるんだよ？", "zh": "在我所看到的景色里，\n无论何时都有{$P$}在哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "c3e66a3675584753e3f72ff5296796ed39247fa1cdfc203ab954125b75bf5341", "ja": "それだけは、この先もずっと変わらないと思う。\nアタシが、どんなアイドルになってもね♪", "zh": "我想，唯独这一点，今后也永远不会改变。\n不管我变成什么样的偶像♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3cba0ba7ff5a0d0de718975656e83a4278a0022b083fb8ce48cd3a2110382608", "ja": "恵美……。", "zh": "惠美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "db6b171824ad2724ed7308ea3d8d6f8b75fbec757cf290d3e5b4c2d17dc4071d", "ja": "ま、アタシの可能性は無限大だからね♪　どこまでも\n自由に！　アタシのやりたいことを頑張るよ！", "zh": "嘛，我的可能性可是无限大的♪　无论走到哪里，都要自由地！努力去做我想做的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5678ee4b274bbeef415309a689167fd9f762f6b11ef3873ca167ae3b06d3fd7e", "ja": "……そうだな。この先も、大変なことが\nたくさんあると思うけど、サポートなら任せてくれ！", "zh": "……是啊。我想今后也会遇到很多困难，但支援的事就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0494_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "f444917e1d26a7385e246815b83c21aaa2b12736ea5b65ef58d4e64bb2c807a8", "ja": "うん、{$P$}、背中は任せるから！　\nなんて。にゃはは♪", "zh": "嗯，{$P$}，背后就交给你啦！\n开玩笑的。喵哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
